  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Solid Large Bandanas are a versatile accessory perfect for a wide range of uses. Measuring 27 inch x 27 inch, these large bandanas can be utilized as facemasks, washcloths, head wraps, handkerchiefs, and more. Made from 100% cotton, they offer the ideal combination of comfort and durability, ensuring they stand up to daily use while providing a soft feel against the skin. Available in a variety of solid colors, these bandanas can be matched to any outfit or purpose. Whether you're looking to protect your face from the sun, keep sweat at bay, or add a stylish touch to your look, Rothco's Solid Bandanas are the perfect choice. Easy to wash and maintain, these bandanas are a practical and stylish addition to your wardrobe. Ideal for outdoor activities, sports, or everyday wear, these bandanas offer endless possibilities for customization and use. Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
